"""Phase B typed adapter: GLADMamba (E5; ECML-PKDD'25) on GX / MS-v2 (RUN_NOTES_ext.md §0).

The port evalpaper/ext/GLADMamba/run_method.py (GLADMamba src @2b2462c, unmodified; einops overlay) is imported
READ-ONLY. Reused as is: load_main_functions (arg_parse, setup_seed), load_data_functions (init_structural_encoding),
load_model_module, resolve_hparams (a typed dataset has no released line -> the modal configuration over all 12 released
AD lines, ratified in A14 for PROTEINS_full / MUTAG), rng_isolated, maybe_stop-compatible context. The port's fit()
(the line-by-line copy of main.py:96-158) is copied here with its evaluation block changed (# CHANGE-TYPED):
  * data = typed_data with GLADMamba's own init_structural_encoding (x_s rw/dg 16, XLX_f, XLX_s) on every graph;
    setup_seed(3407 + seed) before the data and the model (port: before the split code);
  * at every evaluation point each group's test set (test normals + T) is scored through main.py's shuffled test
    DataLoader (batch_size_test 9999 = one batch), unscrambled by graph id; groups 2..K from the saved RNG state S0, the
    first group last as the RNG-carrying set (RUN_NOTES §0a); the adaptive score uses the epoch's training statistics;
  * held-out normals: the port's fixed chunks of batch_size_test, RNG-isolated (A3), with the secondary signals.
Own ORACLE (collector): common epoch (epoch % 5 == 0) with the max 5-seed mean test AUROC, ties lower std, then earlier
(main.py:165-170), finite in all seeds.
  PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 $GLAD_ENVS/ubgold-gpu/bin/python -B GLADMamba_typed.py --generator GX --seed 0
